<view class="page safe-bottom">
  <view class="intro"><text class="eyebrow">DIGITAL IMAGE PROFILE</text><text class="title">더 정밀한 디지털 이미지 프로필</text><text class="zh white">更精确的数字形象档案</text><text class="copy">结合全身比例、正脸与左右侧脸，补充色彩、骨骼、脸型与风格结论。</text></view>
  <view class="slots"><view wx:for="{{slots}}" wx:key="kind" class="slot" data-kind="{{item.kind}}" bindtap="choose"><view class="status">{{uploaded[item.kind]?'✓':'＋'}}</view><text class="slot-ko">{{item.ko}}</text><text class="slot-zh">{{item.zh}}</text><text class="note">{{item.note}}</text><text class="upload">{{uploading===item.kind?'上传中…':uploaded[item.kind]?'重新上传':'拍摄或选择照片'}}</text></view></view>
  <view class="products"><text class="eyebrow">PRODUCT RECOMMENDATIONS</text><text class="section-title">첫 번째 추천 상품 데이터베이스</text><text class="section-zh">首批推荐商品数据库 · UNIQLO</text><view wx:for="{{products}}" wx:key="id" class="product" data-url="{{item.productUrl}}" bindtap="openProduct"><view><text class="brand">{{item.brand}}</text><text class="category">{{item.category}}</text></view><text class="product-name">{{item.nameKo}}</text><text class="product-zh">{{item.nameZh}}　{{item.colorFamily}}</text></view></view>
</view>
